<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<icon_design>
<app_name>Courserasera</app_name>
<colors>
<color_start>#3b82f6</color_start>
<color_end>#8b5cf6</color_end>
</colors>
<background_style>
<ornament>aurora</ornament>
</background_style>
<proportions>
<icon_scale>0.85</icon_scale>
</proportions>
<svg_elements>
<!-- MASTERPIECE: Toga/Graduation Cap with Melting Glass & Resin Depth -->
        <!-- Layer 1: Soft Aurora Glow / Base Platform -->
        <ellipse cx="50" cy="70" rx="30" ry="8" fill="#000000" opacity="0.15" filter="url(#drop-shadow-sm)"/>
        
        <!-- Layer 2: Glowing Core (Underlying Sapphire Crystal) -->
        <polygon points="50,35 75,48 50,61 25,48" fill="#60a5fa" opacity="0.6" filter="url(#drop-shadow-sm)"/>
        
        <!-- Layer 3: Solid Onyx / Dark Metal Mortarboard Base -->
        <polygon points="50,32 80,47 50,62 20,47" fill="url(#glossy-dark)" filter="url(#inner-shadow)"/>
        
        <!-- Layer 4: Deep Sapphire Glass / Refraction Overlay (Solid Polygons, NO stroke) -->
        <!-- Base glass plate -->
        <polygon points="50,32 78,46 50,60 22,46" fill="url(#glossy-white)"/>
        <!-- Inner frosted highlight for depth -->
        <polygon points="50,34 74,46 50,58 26,46" class="frosted-glass"/>
        
        <!-- Cap Skull Cap (Bowl) -->
        <path d="M 32 50 C 32 65, 68 65, 68 50 Z" fill="url(#glossy-dark)" filter="url(#inner-shadow)"/>
        
        <!-- Layer 5: Tassel & Mechanics (Solid Gold Volumes, NO stroke) -->
        <!-- Center Button (Platinum) -->
        <ellipse cx="50" cy="46" rx="4" ry="2" fill="#E5E4E2" filter="url(#inner-shadow)"/>
        <!-- Tassel String (Solid curved path) -->
        <path d="M 50 46 Q 65 52 75 75 L 73 75 Q 63 52 48 46 Z" fill="#FFD700"/>
        <!-- Tassel Fringe (Golden Flare polygon) -->
        <polygon points="74,75 78,85 70,85" fill="#FFD700" filter="url(#inner-shadow)"/>
        
        <!-- Layer 6: Micro-Highlights (Specular reflections) -->
        <ellipse cx="25" cy="47" rx="1.5" ry="1.5" fill="#ffffff" opacity="0.9"/>
        <ellipse cx="50" cy="33" rx="2" ry="1" fill="#ffffff" opacity="0.9"/>
        <ellipse cx="50" cy="45" rx="1" ry="0.5" fill="#ffffff" opacity="0.8"/>
    </svg_elements>
    <visual_prompt>
        Sebuah interpretasi hyper-realistis dari Topi Toga Wisuda. Menggunakan teknik "Melting Geometry" di mana sudut-sudut topi dibuat organik. Dilarang keras menggunakan tag stroke atau line. Seluruh elemen rumbai (tassel) diubah menjadi volume padat (path dan polygon) berwarna emas murni. Lapisan "Sapphire Glass" frosted tebal menutupi pelat dasar "Solid Onyx", ditambahkan micro-specular highlights.
    </visual_prompt>
</icon_design>
